Migration policy locked in (Phase-43 / Prompt 0022 scope):
  * useDriveDetailData.ts: MIGRATE telemetry/position SI fields to convertX-FromSI
    - inside_temp/outside_temp/driver_temp/passenger_temp via convertTempFromSI
    - ideal_range/rated_range/est_range/odometer via convertDistanceFromSI
